    "For texture-controls spec_match/confidence escalation, these tests directly address requested real texture conversion and explicit failure behavior without asserting game-driver shader fidelity. No modifications to these files or threshold changes are made. Earlier independent known-pixel Adam7 tests supplement the committed unit suite; PNG validation is bounded structure/row validation, not exhaustive conformance.",
    "For the corpus claim low confidence, raw full-corpus receipt contains 2297 decoded file rows and 2159 distinct source hashes, zero failures. I independently rechecked byte length and SHA of every source row and raw-receipt summary pin. The run imported pre-PICT optimization producer 8903e109..., as explicitly recorded; I do not relabel it as a full final-code run.",
    "Separate final-code PICT receipt pins fc17acf7..., has 140 distinct PICT inputs and 140 exact agreements. I independently checked each source SHA, dimensions and RGBA checksum against prior full-corpus output. This bounds the only intervening decoder change, namely PICT normalized PNG dispatch. Existing qualified corpus Jev verification and prior independent review remain preserved.",
